<rml>
<head>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../rcss/demo.rcss"/>
</head>
<body class="demo">
	<div id="window">
		<h1>#demo_title</h1>
		<p class="chinese">AbcUi 第三阶段验收：中文渲染、图片与裁剪区域。</p>
		<p>#demo_body</p>
		<img src="../img/test.png"/>
		<div id="clipbox">
			<p class="overflow">Clipped overflow: 0123456789 ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz 该行超出裁剪框后应被切断。</p>
		</div>
		<p id="hint">abc_ui_debugger 可开关 RmlUi 调试器</p>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
